  "description": "Stunning 2 bed apartment available to rent in Dún Laoghaire. \r\n\r\nStandard Features of the apartments include: \r\n- Contemporary, stylish and fully furnished interiors \r\n- Dedicated residents’ concierge service \r\n- Private gym\r\n- Dedicated courtyard and residents’ playground \r\n- Dedicated work areas with free wifi \r\n- Car parking on site \r\n\r\nPlease note that additional mandatory monthly fees may apply, such as parking and or refuse. The leasing team can confirm whether these charges are applicable.\r\n\r\nAt Occu, we believe that renting should be better. That's why we're working hard to bring you the best: smarter, benefit focused and centred around the needs of our residents. No uncertainty, no hidden costs, stunning homes (and we'll let your pets move in too!). \r\nBetter Renting. That's different. \r\n\r\nPlease note: BER's range from A2-A3 \r\nPlease note, photos may not be specific to each available apartment, but all apartments are finished to similar standard. \r\nOccu PSRA License No: 004136",
